{"3764890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PLAYNESE: Master Japanese", "steam_appid": 3764890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAYNESE: Master Japanese: </strong>Turn your daily gaming into Japanese fluency. Explore a massive open world, play a little every day, and naturally progress from complete beginner to fluent Japanese, solo or with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/f30148f0ca29a4a4448b1ad396078073.avif?t=1787965083\" width=1430 height=332 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Some Key Features Include</u>:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・<strong>JLPT N5-N1</strong>, Music, Kanji, Library, Kana, Space and more classrooms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・<strong>Anki Flashcard Decks &amp; Idle cards</strong> on-screen to learn on the go, or create your own</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Read thousands of pages of <strong>religious texts, novels, and classics</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・<strong>Multiplayer Co-Op</strong> <strong>Game Center</strong>, Offline and Online Mini-Games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・<strong>Two Modes</strong>: Full Japanese or Study Mode (furigana + English)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Cover <strong>2,500 kanji,</strong> <strong>Hiragana &amp; Katakana</strong> with mnemonics, writing, and pronunciation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・<strong>Library full of books</strong>, from beginner to advanced, that you can read with narration and quizzes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・<strong>JLPT</strong> <strong>Language test practice</strong> with quizzes and explanations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・<strong>Fully voiced</strong> NPC dialogues</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・<strong>Sea &amp;</strong> <strong>Space exploration</strong> across unique planets filled with NPCs, challenges, music, culture, and real Japanese usage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Enjoy mini-games such as <strong>Blackjack</strong>, <strong>Horse Racing</strong>, <strong>Mecha Battle</strong> and many others</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・<strong>Jukebox</strong> filled with Japanese music, podcasts and background music to unlock, or import your own</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/c59e316e629dbf5807130cbee3027d7f.avif?t=1787965083\" width=1518 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><u>The Study-Play Game Loop</u>: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1️⃣ Learn Japanese to earn money. [All Levels Welcome]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2️⃣<strong> </strong>Buy cards and items, battle creatures, NPCs and Gym Leaders, and earn badges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3️⃣ 🔨Craft, 💱Trade, 🎣Fish and 🌾Harvest resources.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Buy Japanese songs across genres like JPOP, rave, metal, classical, rock, rap, and many more, then enjoy studying their lyrics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/f23fa9251ac7a310ed3900347076faf8.avif?t=1787965083\" width=1560 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ・<strong>PLAYNESE</strong> is a <strong>deeply in-depth</strong> adventure where you’ll have to explore, experiment, and uncover secrets in a constantly growing Open World 🌏</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Study Japanese with <strong>Anki flashcards</strong> tailored to your current level, or <strong>create your own</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/410a162bfa43437372d01ada04cd5d21.avif?t=1787965083\" width=758 height=524 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Absorb Japanese naturally while having fun</u>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/e53b3b580107a9f8c77489344bd775be.avif?t=1787965083\" width=642 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Explore the depths of space, sail the sea, and journey across land as you discover unique planets, memorable NPCs, hidden secrets, and exciting adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> Steam Deck users are providing feedback through the Discord server. Switching to Proton 9 has been reported to work, and native Steam Deck compatibility is planned for a future update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/0ab6312279aaef398cdf0bb98547a39a.avif?t=1787965083\" width=1560 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・<u>EARLY ACCESS</u>: Constant Weekly Updates filled with <u>Language and Adventure</u> :) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >またね！＼（＾○＾）人（＾○＾）／</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAYNESE: Master Japanese: </strong>Turn your daily gaming into Japanese fluency. Explore a massive open world, play a little every day, and naturally progress from complete beginner to fluent Japanese, solo or with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/f30148f0ca29a4a4448b1ad396078073.avif?t=1787965083\" width=1430 height=332 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Some Key Features Include</u>:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・<strong>JLPT N5-N1</strong>, Music, Kanji, Library, Kana, Space and more classrooms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・<