_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/0ab6312279aaef398cdf0bb98547a39a.avif?t=1787965083\" width=1560 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・<u>EARLY ACCESS</u>: Constant Weekly Updates filled with <u>Language and Adventure</u> :) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >またね！＼（＾○＾）人（＾○＾）／</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "🎌 Master Japanese in an open world with single &amp; multiplayer co-op. Learn through Anki flashcards, JLPT quizzes, voiced NPCs, lyrics, mnemonics, and thousands of pages of religious texts, novels, and classics. Explore, craft, fish, and battle with Japanese-themed cards. Major weekly updates. =^.^=", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/49f6fa188d70c728dc819cf96daba873d2af0f40/header.jpg?t=1787965083", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/41d4e1a4e8c029c922e2c27fde173d45fbee4a20/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787965083", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/41d4e1a4e8c029c922e2c27fde173d45fbee4a20/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787965083", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows® 7/8/8.1/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core2 Duo or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 9/OpenGL 4.1 capable GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated or dedicated sound card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Best experienced with sound as it`s a language game.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows® 7/8/8.1/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor: